@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<!-- Landing Page Section -->
<section id="landing-page" class="landing-section">
    <div class="container text-center text-white">
        <h1 class="display-4">Are you ready to level up your trading?</h1>
        <a class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-angles-down"></i></a>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- About Section -->
<section id="about" class="p-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>
            Dobrusky Capital LLC, headquartered in Lincoln, Nebraska, is a day trading company founded in 2023 by Austin Dobrusky.
            Our primary focus is on trading derivative securities of the S&P 500, specifically options and futures contracts.
            Our approach is data-driven and grounded in understanding the fundamental dynamics of the market to make informed intraday trading decisions. We rely on our strengths in analyzing volume and price action data, coupled with market sentiment, to take calculated risks when trading opportunities present themselves.
            In addition to trading, Austin brings over 8 years of experience in software development. 
            We have applied this expertise to our trading strategies, developing three proprietary trading indicators that have become a cornerstone of our daily operations at Dobrusky Capital LLC.
        </p>
        <p>
            Beyond our trading activities, our mission is to provide as much value as possible to growing traders. 
            Understanding the difficulty of day trading, we are committed to sharing knowledge and resources to help others succeed in their trading journey. 
            This commitment is demonstrated through the free education we offer and the release of the "Dobrusky Capital LLC 90-Day Trading Journal," a tool designed to help traders continuously improve their trading skills and mindset.
            This meticulously structured trading journal, used daily at Dobrusky Capital LLC, has been instrumental in enhancing the company's consistency and performance.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>


<!-- Indicators Section -->
<section id="indicators" class="bg-light p-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Our Trading Indicators</h2>
        <p>
            We have developed three proprietary trading indicators for TradingView. These indicators are not designed to tell you when to enter or exit trades; rather, they provide fast and reliable information that you could miss otherwise. 
            You still need to know how to read the market; the purpose of the indicators is to increase the speed at which you can read it.
            These indicators are stable and are currently undergoing testing in our daily trade operations at Dobrusky Capital LLC.
            They are not yet available for purchase but will be released as soon as the testing phase is complete.
        </p>

        <div class="indicator-row">
            <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/volumeprofile.png")" alt="Volume Profile Indicator" class="indicator-image">
            <div class="indicator-description">
                <h3>Volume Profile</h3>
                <p>This indicator displays a volume profile (volume by price) that shows both cumulative volume and buy/sell pressure.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="indicator-row">
            <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/volumebars.png")" alt="Buy/Sell Volume Bars Indicator" class="indicator-image">
            <div class="indicator-description">
                <h3>Buy/Sell Volume Bars</h3>
                <p>This indicator displays buy/sell volume bars (volume by time). 
                    It features two customizable metrics to gauge a baseline volume. The indicator offers a simple moving average as well as a proprietary "baseline" metric.
                    This proprietary metric provides a more accurate baseline volume than the simple moving average.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="indicator-row">
            <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/vpaindicator.png")" alt="Volume Price Analysis Indicator" class="indicator-image">
            <div class="indicator-description">
                <h3>VPA Indicator</h3>
                <p>This indicator is designed to assist traders in identifying valuable volume price analysis (VPA) information. 
                    This indicator highlights important candlesticks, volume conditions, and price levels that can provide insights into potential market structure and direction.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Trading Journal Section -->
<section id="journal" class="p-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Trading Journal</h2>
        <div class="journal-content-wrapper">
            <div>
                <p>
                    At Dobrusky Capital LLC we believe in the importance of journaling when trying to become a successful trader.
                    Without keeping track of each of your trades, the technical mistakes, and the psychological mistakes, you will never succeed.
                    We created this journal because we saw a need within the retail trading industry for a carefully structured handwritten journal
                    that will help traders progress as fast as possible. We created this journal first and foremost for the use of the company, but we believe that any growing trader could find serious value within it.
                </p>
                <p>
                    As mentioned above, our mission is to provide as much value to growing traders as we can.
                    We truly believe in the power of our journal, it has improved the performance of our company immensely, and we would like to share a <strong>free</strong> sneak peak of it with you.
                    We understand that a structured handwritten journal might not be for everyone, and we don't want to waste your time and money, so we decided to give out the first few pages for free.
                </p>
                <p>
                    We want to provide as much value as possible, so by subscribing to our email list you will not only receive a free sneak peek at our invaluable journal, but also receive access to our simple risk management formula that, when strictly followed, will ensure that you <em>always live to trade another day</em>.
                    Let us remind you that the reason most traders fail is because they have no risk management rules.
                    They lose all of their money in a short period of time, stopping them from sticking around long enough to grow their skills enough to be consistent. <em>They don't live to trade another day.</em>
                </p>
                <p>
                    The journal itself features detailed trade metrics, emotion tracking, and much more to
                    support a comprehensive trading strategy and psychological framework. A full description of the journal and its features can be found <a target="_blank" href="https://www.amazon.com/Dobrusky-Capital-90-Day-Trading-Journal/dp/B0CPY3FJ39">here</a>.
                </p>
            </div>
            <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/journal.jpg")" alt="Dobrusky Capital LLC 90-Day Trading Journal">
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Email Sign-Up Form -->
<section class="bg-light p-5">
    <form class="email-signup">
        <label for="emailInput" class="form-label">Receive your free education and sneak peek of the trading journal now!</label>
        <div>
            <input type="email" class="form-control" id="emailInput" placeholder="name@example.com">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Let's go</button>
        </div>
    </form>
</section>

<script>
    let isHome = true;
</script>
